; The joint gizmo shapes of the two limit joints, the one variable no other golden moves: a HingeJoint3D
; draws its axis and an arc around Z toward each body, a SliderJoint3D its travel with a square at each
; end and an arc around X toward each body (ADR-0056). Each joint has two bodies away from it and not
; straight above or below it, and limits that are not Godot's defaults. No other scene shows a
; regression in a gizmo shape, since only a golden with `gizmos: true` draws one.
